OL,8,G0232 Tech Life
OL,9,     FCloudy lines in the sky, caused by
OL,10,     Faircraft engines, are called
OL,11,     Fcontrails. They're harmful to the
OL,12,     Fenvironment. Now a project is
OL,13,     Funderway, using AI, to reduce the
OL,14,     Famount generated.
