OL,6,     FHermany's search for her
OL,7,     Fmysterious grandad revealed her
OL,8,     Findigenous roots in Tierra del
OL,9,     FFuego. With her daughter, she
OL,10,     Fhelped change Chilean law for a
OL,11,     Fpeople once thought extinct.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1980, an Australian birthday
OL,14,     Fcake book was launched that would
OL,15,     Finspire generations. Agnes Lee
OL,16,     Fdesigned its famous duck cake,
OL,17,     Flater featured in Bluey.
